// Vendored from compact-end-2-end @ 88ad65d0e23b11352c1194210e03ff64923c1636,
// dapps/evm-erc20/contracts/EvmErc20.compact, 2026-08-11.
// Local changes: renamed TokenAA; split the genesis recipient from the admin;
// OpenZeppelin Ownable gates mint, mintToEthAddress, and arbitrary-account
// _burn. PLAN-04 sections 3-4 are intentionally not present.
